Migrations for the users database (Alembic). Run every command from the repo root.

Apply all migrations (after pulling, or on a new database):
    alembic -c backend/users/alembic.ini upgrade head

After changing a table in backend/users/models.py, create a migration, then READ it
before applying (autogenerate can miss renames and some defaults):
    alembic -c backend/users/alembic.ini revision --autogenerate -m "add avatar_url to users"
    alembic -c backend/users/alembic.ini upgrade head

Undo the last migration:
    alembic -c backend/users/alembic.ini downgrade -1

Where am I / what exists:
    alembic -c backend/users/alembic.ini current
    alembic -c backend/users/alembic.ini history

The database URL comes from USERS_DATABASE_URL (see backend/users/config.py).